ss=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; counts = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\r\ncounts.put(&quot;a&quot;, 1);\r\ncounts.getOrDefault(&quot;b&quot;, 0);         // 없으면 기본값\r\ncounts.merge(&quot;a&quot;, 1, Integer::sum);  // 누적\r\n\r\nfor (Map.Entry&lt;String, Integer&gt; e : counts.entrySet()) {\r\n    System.out.println(e.getKey() + &quot;=&quot; + e.getValue());\r\n}\r\n\r\nMap&lt;String, String&gt; labels = Map.of(&quot;ok&quot;, &quot;확인&quot;, &quot;cancel&quot;, &quot;취소&quot;);   // 불변</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">키-값 묶음. TS 의 인덱스 시그니처 / Record&lt;string, T&gt;, Python 의 dict 와 같은 용도</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 인터페이스 › 인덱스 시그니처</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/object/map","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/java/object"}],"hasImage":false}